SUBJECT:
Consideration to Purchase between the City of Cheyenne, and Thomson Reuters,
for a Three (3) year software agreement to utilize the WestLaw Legal Research
Platform for the City of Cheyenne Attorney’s Office
______________________________________________
This is a sole source purchase through Thomson Reuters, therefore no bids were requested (Sole
Source Letter included).
This request is for a Three (3) year software agreement to utilize the WestLaw Legal Research
Platform for the City of Cheyenne Attorney’s Office.
WestLaw is the only online legal research platform that contains the resources and materials
needed to operate the City Attorney’s Office.
The total request purchase amount is $83,216.24, split over three (3) years.

