REQUEST TO PURCHASE OVER $35,000.00
Consideration to Purchase between the City of Cheyenne, and Thomson Reuters, for a Three (3)
year software agreement to utilize the WestLaw Legal Research Platform for the City of
Cheyenne Attorney’s Office.  The total amount of the Contract over three (3) years is $83,216.64.
